    },
    {
      question: 'Can I convert my existing neon sign to LED?',
      answer: 'Yes, in many cases converting from neon to LED is possible and economically worthwhile. The advantages: 70-80% lower power consumption, significantly less maintenance, no mercury disposal, better color consistency over lifespan. Often existing housings can be reused. We are happy to check on-site whether your existing system can be converted and create a cost-benefit analysis.',
    },
  ],
